{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate is a sci-fi horror survival experience, where a mysterious virus is consuming the only living alien. No cure exist so you must travel to a black hole and buy time to scientist until they develop a cure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot around a black hole infested by debris falling into it. You only have one life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fuel is very hard to obtain and your ship consumes it quickly, be mindful of planning a round trip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will pilot multiple spaceships in withing the same time frame, and the decisions you make will impact the other missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with time dilation. Reshape the way you think about time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience is designed to include various intriguing story twists.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581160?t=1757448639","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581160/bddfd183d143991f4155364a5592f7cbf8daff19/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757448639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581160/6c9838d52387e633a945531ca70bf687bce7f625/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757448639","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581160/6c9838d52387e633a945531ca70bf687bce7f625/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757448639","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate is a sci-fi horror survival experience, where a mysterious virus is consuming the only living alien. No cure exist so you must travel to a black hole and buy time to scientist u